Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='publishedplaintext', at=datetime(2026, 10, 10, 0, 0, 0), actor='owner', title='Every published byte is plain text both checks read, or admitted by digest at a terminal', body="*Every published byte is plain text both checks read, or admitted* (2026-10-10, the owner: hand-rolled decoders are an arms race a filter loses): secrets are gitleaks's (`scripts/secret-rules.toml`, a fixture key by fingerprint in `.gitleaksignore`); the matcher reads words and decodes nothing; a file it cannot read (a binary, a base64 or hex run, a quoted-printable body) or a fingerprinted one is a hit until `scripts/public-admitted.sha256` lists its path and digest, a line `train.sh publish --admit` takes at a terminal, as it takes a new fingerprint or a change to the rules. `public-scan.sh` runs the same guard over every commit of a Prodrome range. `-t 0` stops cron and land, not a shell (SECURITY.md).", rationale='The owner, 2026-10-10: hand-rolled decoders are an arms race a filter loses.', supersedes=()))